[6.517963, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6.843408, "o", "Hello! I'm Hacksune Miklu! \r\n I'm a Hatsune Miku inspired CLI tool that can talk to you about Project Sekai. \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣤⣀⣀⠀⠀⣀⡠⠴⠒⠚⠉⠉⠓⠒⠦⣄⣶⠒⣷⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠘⡷⢬⣉⠉⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠠⡌⠻⣧⢻⣧⣤⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣖⠗⡋⢹⠀⠀⢰⡄⠀⠀⢸⣷⡀⠀⣠⠽⣆⢼⣇⢻⣸⡄⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⡜⣡⣶⢋⡏⠙⢢⣏⣇⠀⠀⠈⣇⡵⡏⠀⠀⢹⡏⢾⣿⠃⢿⡆⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣾⢿⢻⣏⣿⡇⡄⣾⠀⠹⡄⠄⠀⡇⠀⠹⣤⠈⠹⣿⣾⢸⠀⢘⣷⣄⣀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢠⣴⣯⣿⣽⣿⣷⢸⡗⠦⣄⡹⣼⣄⣿⣴⠛⠹⡄⡇⣿⣿⠾⠚⢹⢿⢽⣽⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣸⣿⣞⣾⣿⢿⣯⢻⢻⡴⠞⠁⠈⠻⣿⣌⡉⠓⣿⣰⡿⠀⠀⠀⠸⡜⡾⣿⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⡴⣡⠊⢸⣹⠁⠈⠙⣾⡄⠁⠀⢰⠛⠉⠉⠉⢳⣀⣿⣿⠃⠀⠀⣀⣀⣧⣿⡞⣷⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣠⠋⡴⠁⠀⠸⢿⣤⣤⣤⣹⣿⣷⣶⣾⣷⣶⣶⣺⣋⣽⣿⣷⠶⠟⠛⠋⢧⠀⠀⠸⡜⣷⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n"]
[6.844757, "o", "⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⡜⠁⡰⠁⠀⠀⢠⡿⠀⠀⠀⠉⠉⠉⠙⢻⡟⣹⣿⠃⣿⠋⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠸⡄⠀⠀⢣⠹⣧⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⢠⠏⡀⢠⠇⠀⠀⢠⡿⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀⣤⣶⡴⠚⢻⠡⣸⠀⢹⣆⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡇⠀⠀⠸⡄⢻⣇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⢀⡏⣼⠁⢸⠀⠀⠀⣾⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢻⣿⣧⣀⣬⠋⠁⠀⣠⣿⣶⣆⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡇⠀⠀⠀⡇⠈⣿⡀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⣸⣸⣿⠀⡇⠀⢰⣸⡟⠀⠀⠀⣀⣠⠴⠚⣟⣻⣧⣯⣗⣤⣾⣿⣿⡿⠋⠀⠀⠀⠀⣸⣤⠀⠀⠀⡇⡆⢻⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⣿⡿⢸⡀⣇⠀⣸⣿⡁⠀⣾⣻⡁⣀⣤⣶⠟⠋⠉⠛⢿⣋⣻⡏⠉⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢰⣿⡇⠀⠀⠀⣷⡇⣸⡄⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠿⠇⠀⢧⢸⠀⣿⡿⠇⠀⠈⠛⠛⠋⠉⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⡟⠀⣿⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢠⣿⣿⡇⠀⠀⣰⡿⣧⣿⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢿⣄⣹⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⢰⡇⠀⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣸⡿⢸⠁⢠⣾⠋⢰⣿⡏⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠉⠛⠛⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⣼⣶⣶⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠉⠁⢸⣶⡟⠁⠀⠾⠟⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠉⠉⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠉⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ \r\n type in 'miklu greeting' then either 'legacy', 'L/n', 'MMJ', 'VBS', 'WxS', or 'n25' \r\n to see one of my six unique greetings! \r\n...or try typing in 'miklu helpme' to see all my commands!\r\n"]
