[30.738254, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[30.893429, "o", "This place is called the Tree of Feelings sekai, and as you might have guessed, \r\n this tree is made of all the feelings of the owners of these sekais! \r\n\r\n Oh, you want to know what I am doing? \r\n I watch over all the sekai's and their owners. \r\n I hope they can all find their true feelings!\r\n"]
