[68.183614, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[68.311095, "o", "Well, as you've probably guessed based on the name, this sekai mostly resembles an empty school. \r\nThere are even lots of empty classrooms and an acessible roof where you can see the stars at night! \r\n\r\nOh, you want to know what I'm doing? \r\nI'm tuning my guitar so I can practice with the girls and Luka later!\r\n"]
