[101.0294, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.156831, "o", "This sekai has soooo many different stages in it! \r\nIf you look out over the stages, you can see all the light sticks waving in the crowd! \r\n\r\n Ah! I'm late for my idol training session with Rin!\r\n"]
