[124.806372, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[124.923609, "o", "This sekai is mostly a bunch of streets and allyways. \r\nAlthough, MEIKO has a cafe over there. She makes pretty good coffee and desserts, too! \r\n\r\nWell, I've got to go practice with the Kagamines. \r\n"]
