[154.952772, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[155.100926, "o", "This sekai has so many different things in it, I'm so excited to show all of them to you!\r\n Should I show you the super fwoosh-fwoosh train or - the plushies might also be holding a show right now... \r\nUuuee! There's so much to chose from...\r\n\r\n Oh, you wonder why this sekai is called the wonderland sekai and not something like the park sekai?\r\n I'll go find Tsukasa-kun and ask him right now! Tsukasa-kunnnn!\r\n"]
